s in flight (recent commits W2â€“W5 + the W3 correction on this branch). â€” *anchor: memory `aurora-awareness-revamp.md`; recent commits on `foreman/aurora-revamp`*\n\nOne caveat worth flagging: the title you gave (\"session-start playbook\") is actually the name of the **`CLAUDE.md` instruction file**, not the project itself â€” Aurora is the catalog/awareness system above; that file is just its onboarding doc.\n\nWant me to verify any of these against the live plan doc (`docs/NIGHTLY_SWEEP_PLAN.md`) or the dashboard code?"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4419,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7405,"cache_read_input_tokens":20597,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7405},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"510a9f8b-8eaf-407a-a4bf-25579c7d96a5","uuid":"0d3c3294-964d-43be-a9c9-a53fa9a82a10","request_id":"req_011Cc1Hhydcm71jVscvx6YP2"}
